## Article 21. Free of charge review of appeals

```catala
declaration scope Article21FreeOfCharge:
  input appealType content AppealType
  output reviewIsFree content YesNo
  output noFeeCharged content YesNo

scope Article21FreeOfCharge:
  label review_free definition reviewIsFree equals Yes

  label no_fee definition noFeeCharged equals Yes
```

## Article 22. Personal reception of citizens

```catala
declaration scope Article22PersonalReception:
  input receptionScheduled content YesNo
  input quarantineInEffect content YesNo
  input receptionSuspended content YesNo
  input oralAppealMade content YesNo
  output personalReceptionRequired content YesNo
  output receptionSchedulePublished content YesNo
  output receptionCanBeSuspendedDuringQuarantine content YesNo
  output oralAppealRegistered content YesNo
  output oralAppealReviewedAsWritten content YesNo
  output notificationOfResultsRequired content YesNo

scope Article22PersonalReception:
  label reception_required definition personalReceptionRequired equals Yes

  label schedule_published definition receptionSchedulePublished equals Yes

  label quarantine_exception
    exception default_not_quarantine

  definition receptionCanBeSuspendedDuringQuarantine under condition
    quarantineInEffect = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_not_quarantine definition receptionCanBeSuspendedDuringQuarantine equals No

  label oral_registered_exception
    exception default_not_oral

  definition oralAppealRegistered under condition
    oralAppealMade = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_not_oral definition oralAppealRegistered equals No

  label oral_reviewed_as_written definition oralAppealReviewedAsWritten equals Yes

  label notification_required definition notificationOfResultsRequired equals Yes
```

## Article 23. Organization of reception of citizens by senior officials

```catala
declaration scope Article23SeniorOfficialsReception:
  input addressee content AddresseeType
  output presidentSetsOwnProcedure content YesNo
  output parliamentChairSetsOwnProcedure content YesNo
  output primeMinisterSetsOwnProcedure content YesNo

scope Article23SeniorOfficialsReception:
  label president_exception
    exception default_not_president

  definition presidentSetsOwnProcedure under condition
    addressee = President
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_not_president definition presidentSetsOwnProcedure equals No

  label parliament_exception
    exception default_not_parliament

  definition parliamentChairSetsOwnProcedure under condition
    addressee = Parliament
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_not_parliament definition parliamentChairSetsOwnProcedure equals No

  label pm_exception
    exception default_not_pm

  definition primeMinisterSetsOwnProcedure under condition
    addressee = Cabinet
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_not_pm definition primeMinisterSetsOwnProcedure equals No
```